{
  "title": "登录用户",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <h1>登录用户</h1>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">要访问 Innovator，每个用户通常需要通过 Innovator 认证屏幕登录，该屏幕要求输入用户名和密码。用户名或登录名及密码定义了一个登录用户。</span> <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">在 Innovator 中，当创建登录用户时，系统会自动为其分配一个关联的身份组。</span> <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">登录用户与 Innovator 身份组之间的链接称为别名。</span></p>\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" src=\"/aras-images/Logon Users Figure 1.PNG\" style=\"border: none;\"></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">以下是此概念在 Innovator 中的工作方式。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>首先，管理员必须创建登录用户：</p>\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body\">1. 在导航窗格中选择 <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">管理</b>&gt;<b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">用户</b>。将出现以下菜单：</p>\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/userbuttons.jpg\"></p>\n  \n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">2. 点击 <strong>搜索用户 </strong></span>查看系统中已有的用户。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">3. 点击 <strong>创建新用户。</strong>将出现以下对话框：<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/createusr.jpg\"></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">       4. 按照说明填写对话框中的以下属性：</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span class=\"Bold\"></span><span class=\"Bold\">登录名</span> - 用户在认证屏幕上输入以访问 Innovator 的登录用户名。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span class=\"Bold\">密码</span> - 用户在认证屏幕上输入以访问 Innovator 的密码。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\">- 重新输入密码以确认。<span class=\"Bold\">确认密码</span></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Warning_Black_Indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Warning_paragraph\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\"><span class=\"Warning\">警告：登录名和密码区分大小写。</span></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><span class=\"Bold\">允许登录</span> - 如果用户拥有登录权限，请勾选此复选框。不勾选此框将禁止用户通过认证屏幕访问 Innovator。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  \n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-left: 50px;\">       以下对话框属性为可选项，可根据需要填写：</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  \n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">名</span> - 用户的名字</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">姓</span> - 用户的姓氏</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">公司名称</span> - 用户所在公司的名称</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">电子邮件</span> - 用户的电子邮件地址。如果用户需要接收特定活动通知和分配给他们的动作项并转发到其收件箱，则此信息是必需的。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">电话</span> - 用户的电话号码</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">邮件分机号</span> - 用户的邮件分机号</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">传真</span> - 用户的传真号码</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">家庭电话</span> - 用户的家庭电话号码</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">手机</span> - 用户的手机号码</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">寻呼机</span> - 用户的寻呼机号码</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">员工编号</span> - 用户的员工编号。公司通常使用此信息来统计员工活动指标。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">经理</span> - 用户经理的身份。此信息通常用于委派目的或权限结构。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">工作目录</span> - 用户访问的目录。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">起始页面</span> - </p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" level=\"2\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"text-indent: -30px; margin-left: 80px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">默认保险库</span> - 提供安全文件存储的保险库。</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body\">5. 从导航窗格中选择 <b>管理</b>&gt; <b>身份组</b>，然后点击 <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">搜索</b> <img src=\"/aras-images/searchicon.jpg\"> <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>以显示所有身份组。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body\">可以为群组身份组分配特定权限。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>现在可以将此身份组与其他身份组合并以创建群组身份组。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>因此，Innovator 会为每个登录用户自动创建一个身份组。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>您应该能看到系统已为上述用户自动创建了一个身份组，且该身份组是一个别名（请注意\"是否别名\"属性已勾选或设置为 True）。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/idlist.jpg\"></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  <h2>别名选项卡</h2>\n  \n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">查看与特定登录用户关联的身份组的另一种方式是查看用户表单中\"别名\"选项卡下的列表。</span></span></p>\n  \n  \n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 6.0pt; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: 6.0pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"></span> <span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">1. 从导航窗格中选择 <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">管理</b> &gt; <b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">用户</b>。让我们打开之前创建的用户。</span> 请注意对话框主工具栏中的\"隐藏选项卡\"箭头。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>如果点击向下箭头，您将看到此用户的选项卡属性：</p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/hidtab.jpg\"></p>\n  <!--?rh-list_start class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" level=\"1\" an=\"1\" style=\"list-style: rh-list;\n                                 list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n  \n  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  \n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body\">有两个选项卡：别名和读取保险库：</p>\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/tabs.jpg\"></p>\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>别名选项卡列出了与此登录用户关联（别名）的所有 Innovator 身份组。<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> </span>您也可以手动从此列表中添加或删除条目。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\">读取保险库选项卡使您可以添加用于存储用户信息的保险库。</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/readvault.jpg\"></p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\">2. 点击\"选择条目\"按钮 <img src=\"/aras-images/selitems.jpg\"> 将保险库与用户关联。将出现保险库搜索对话框：</p>\n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\"><img src=\"/aras-images/vaultdialog.jpg\"></p>\n  \n  <p class=\"Content_body_indented\">3. 选择 Default 并点击\"返回所选\"按钮 <img src=\"/aras-images/returnselect.jpg\"> 将其添加。</p>\n  \n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "Logon_Users.htm"
}